# Production build only. Vite loads this file in addition to .env during
# `npm run build` (production mode), and mode-specific values win — so this
# overrides the local-dev VITE_API_URL (http://localhost:8000) without touching .env.
#
# Production backend is ECS Fargate behind an ALB, fronted by the SAME CloudFront
# distribution that serves this SPA: CloudFront routes /admin/* and /documents/*
# to the ALB. So the frontend must call the backend SAME-ORIGIN — an empty value
# makes `${VITE_API_URL}/admin/...` resolve to a relative `/admin/...` path.
# (The old Lambda + API Gateway endpoint is retired; do not point here.)
VITE_API_URL=
